{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to restore the fertility of your town's land, play the role of Nikolos, a reckless young man who, with the <strong>blessing of the goddess Demeter</strong>, can <strong>change the seasons</strong>. Put your <strong>observation</strong> and <strong>logic</strong> skills to good use in this single-player <strong>3D puzzle game</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather <strong>offerings</strong> from the various scenery so that Demeter can help you find your way, collect <strong>scrolls</strong> that hold mysterious secrets and find a way out of <strong>complex situations</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of <strong>challenges</strong> await you, from pressure plates to pendulum swings, you'll need to <strong>solve multiple mechanisms</strong> to progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the result of a <strong>final year project</strong>, now available on Steam! We hope you will enjoy it \u2014 have fun, and don't hesitate to <strong>share your feedback</strong> with us!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Offering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3914680/ff515210a694dc065a2e53f3bb125a05acbca6ff.jpg"},{"name":"The First Ruins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3914680/2178e03091550660f314938bb847d245641795d3.jpg"},{"name":"Spring Anew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3914680/8ad876b021c81f8694a8a08907782c5b9d7a148f.jpg"},{"name":"The colapsing ground","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3914680/24f565fff16172da9019cb009c4d2c8bcbf9ff05.jpg"},{"name":"The Heroes of Seasons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat